Erlang/OTP sources
------------------

Hyperlang pins Erlang/OTP 29 (kernel 11.0.2, stdlib 8.0.1).

Unmodified reference copies, kept in the source repository under vendor/:

  vendor/otp_kernel_11_0_2/src/file.erl            (kernel 11.0.2)
  vendor/otp_kernel_11_0_2/include/file.hrl        (kernel 11.0.2)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/erl_scan.erl             (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/erl_parse.yrl            (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/erl_parse.erl            (stdlib 8.0.1, generated from erl_parse.yrl)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/filelib.erl          (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/io_lib.erl           (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/io_lib_format.erl    (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/io_lib_fread.erl     (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/io_lib_pretty.erl    (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/gen.erl              (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/gen_server.erl       (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/gen_statem.erl       (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/gen_event.erl        (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/proc_lib.erl         (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/supervisor.erl       (stdlib 8.0.1)
  vendor/otp_stdlib_8_0_1/src/sys.erl              (stdlib 8.0.1)

Derived files, modified by the Hyperlang Authors:

  src/hyperlang_otp_scan.erl
      Derived from stdlib 8.0.1 erl_scan.erl. Renamed module; atom-producing
      paths patched so untrusted names stay binaries. The change is recorded
      in patches/hyperlang_otp_scan.patch.
  src/hyperlang_otp_parse.erl
      Derived from stdlib 8.0.1 erl_parse.erl (generated from erl_parse.yrl).
      Renamed module; atom-producing paths patched. The change is recorded in
      patches/hyperlang_otp_parse.patch.
  src/hyperlang_otp_io_lib.erl
  src/hyperlang_otp_io_lib_format.erl
  src/hyperlang_otp_io_lib_fread.erl
  src/hyperlang_otp_io_lib_pretty.erl
      Derived from stdlib 8.0.1 io_lib.erl, io_lib_format.erl,
      io_lib_fread.erl and io_lib_pretty.erl. Module names and cross-module
      references renamed by scripts/rewrite_otp_formatting_modules.sh.
  priv/guest_lib/gen.erl
  priv/guest_lib/gen_server.erl
  priv/guest_lib/gen_statem.erl
  priv/guest_lib/gen_event.erl
  priv/guest_lib/proc_lib.erl
  priv/guest_lib/supervisor.erl
  priv/guest_lib/otp_sys.erl
      Guest ports of the stdlib 8.0.1 modules of the same name (otp_sys.erl
      ports sys.erl). They are rewritten to run as Hyperlang guest code.
